OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will
OL,6,Fremain mostly cloudy and showery
OL,7,Fduring this evening. The showers will
OL,8,Fbecome well scattered overnight with
OL,9,Fdrier and clearer spells increasing
OL,10,Flater. Breezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA bright day with sunny spells
OL,13,Fand a scattering of showers. The
OL,14,Fshowers dying back towards the west
OL,15,Fcoast during the afternoon, then
OL,16,Fmainly dry through the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
