OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FWet
OL,6,Fand windy early on Saturday, turning
OL,7,Fdrier and brighter from the west.
OL,8,FMainly dry and bright on Sunday then
OL,9,Fcloudy with outbreaks of rain on
OL,10,FMonday.
